						</div>
						<div class="publication-content">
							<div class="publication-badges">
								<span class="badge conference">Workshop</span>
								<span class="badge ranking">CVPR 2026</span>
								<span class="badge year">May 2026</span>
							</div>
							<h3>CLOVES-4603: Benchmarking Classical Texture Features and Fine-Tuned Deep Models for Clove Quality Grading</h3>
							<p class="authors"><strong>Innocent Nyalala</strong>, Patrick Ndowo Vincent</p>
							<p class="venue">
								<a href="https://cvpr.thecvf.com/Conferences/2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">7th Workshop on Vision for Agriculture (CV4A) @ CVPR 2026</a>
							</p>
							<p class="abstract">
								Introduces the CLOVES-4603 dataset and benchmarks classical texture features (LBP, GLCM, HOG) against fine-tuned deep learning models for automated clove quality grading, addressing a critical post-harvest challenge for Zanzibar's primary export crop.
							</p>
							<div class="tags">
								<span class="tag">Agriculture</span>
								<span class="tag">Computer Vision</span>
								<span class="tag">Zanzibar</span>
								<span class="tag">Benchmarking</span>
							</div>
							<div class="links">
								<button class="link cite" data-citation="cloves2026">Cite</button>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

