							<h3>Few-Shot Transfer Learning for Cassava Leaf Disease Detection Under East African Field Conditions</h3>
							<p class="authors">Patrick Ndowo, <strong>Innocent Nyalala</strong></p>
							<p class="venue">
								<a href="https://www.datascienceafrica.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DSA 2026 Workshop</a>, Makerere University, Kampala, Uganda (23–24 July 2026) — Poster Presentation
							</p>
							<p class="abstract">
								Evaluates few-shot transfer learning strategies for cassava leaf disease detection, specifically addressing the domain shift challenges arising from real-world East African field image conditions compared to curated benchmark data.
							</p>
